All-history observed UI: Import from online accounts

Import old and recent Claude and ChatGPT conversations straight from the websites, with no export. Threadkeeper reads through your own signed-in session in this browser, one conversation at a time, and only reads. Each one is then summarized and filed like any other thread.

All history reads every available page in the active account or workspace, including archived ChatGPT chats. Keep the browser and site tabs open while it runs. Cancel at any time; run it again to skip complete, unchanged conversations and continue importing. Deleted or unavailable chats cannot be recovered.

